{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_11212200","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11212200","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1121220001:0":{"text":"이거 놔... 나 혼자서도 갈 수 있어!","source_cn":"放开我……我能自己走！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09470B81645980C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121220002:0":{"text":"네가 자꾸 도망치려고 하니까, 내가 이러는 거 아니야.","source_cn":"姑娘，要不是你一路上好几次想要逃跑，我也不至于这么对你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD59F7F7B3FDC8C13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1121220003:0":{"text":"발렌, 돌아왔나? 보아하니 수확이 있었던 모양이군.","source_cn":"维伦，你们回来了，看样子有所收获。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF4077DB083CC6D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1121220004:1":{"text":"장군님, 저희가 블랙골드 여사의 딸을 잡아 왔습니다. 전혀 짐작도 못 하셨죠?","source_cn":"将军，你一定想不到，我们抓住了黑金女士的女儿。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5947800B7B8F5561","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1121220005:2":{"text":"뭐라고! 딸??","source_cn":"什么！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x651734008AA80CB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1121220006:1":{"text":"정확하게 말하면... 자신이 블랙골드 여사의 딸이라고 자칭하고 있어요. 신분은 확인해 봐야 할 것 같아요.","source_cn":"准确来说……她自称是黑金女士的女儿，我认为她的身份还有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B0FAD09644F33DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1121220007:1":{"text":"여러분이 보시는 바와 같이 이 아이의 모습은 와일더스 연맹의 사람과 더 비슷해요.","source_cn":"如各位所见，她的长相更像是绿裔联盟的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD066A52BDDEBB3A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1121220008:1":{"text":"레미아, 너도 그렇게 생각하지?","source_cn":"蕾米雅，你也这么认为吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3EA862B91DAD8AC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1121220009:0":{"text":"넌...","source_cn":"你是——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC719D3F612EC005D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1121220010:0":{"text":"알루라?","source_cn":"阿露拉？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x672EBB37991A898D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1121220011:0":{"text":"뭐...?","source_cn":"什么……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42DA373FF8985A88","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1121220012:2":{"text":"알루라 맞지...? 아니야, 알루라가 여기에 나타날 리가 없지. 내가 잘못 본 걸 거야.","source_cn":"是阿露拉吗……不对，她不可能出现在这里，是我认错了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x73197D1241A29B25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1121220013:0":{"text":"이름...\n조금 전 그건 누구의 이름이지?","source_cn":"名字……\\n刚才那个名字，是谁的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCDDC42138DC894D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1121220014:0":{"text":"내가 왜 알려줘야 하지?","source_cn":"我为什么要告诉你？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEF22D56607F7E9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1121220015:0":{"text":"그 이름이 내 꿈속에서 아주 여러 번 등장했어.","source_cn":"因为那个名字在我的梦中出现过，出现了很多很多次。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F0E04B854F65011","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1121220016:0":{"text":"난... 그게 누구의 이름인지 알고 싶어.","source_cn":"我……想知道它属于谁。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB11EFB782F65626C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1121220017:0":{"text":"안 알려줄 거야. 지금 우린 적이니까.","source_cn":"不告诉你哦。从现在的立场来说，我们可是敌人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62B2728D41DF3603","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1121220018:0":{"text":"뭔가 말 못 할 사정이 있는 것 같은데...","source_cn":"似乎有些隐情啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x706079407EB5194E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1121220019:0":{"text":"이 아이를 데리고 가서 잘 지키도록 해.","source_cn":"来人，先把这位姑娘带下去，严加看管。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC214B657CFC8BBBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1121220020:0":{"text":"이봐, 거기 고양이 귀...","source_cn":"那个长着猫耳朵的人——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DE5A2CDC7B0A765","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1121220021:0":{"text":"고양이 귀라니! 내 이름은 레미아야. 멋대로 별명 짓지 말라고.","source_cn":"打住！我叫蕾米雅，不要随便给我取外号。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FE938578FE91385","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1121220022:0":{"text":"내가 도망가지 않겠다면 아까 그 이름이 누구의 것인지 알려줄 거야?","source_cn":"如果我不逃走，你会告诉我吗？告诉我那个名字的主人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE400602778B0183","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1121220023:0":{"text":"봐서.","source_cn":"看我的心情咯。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA5ECCD3D2A6AB60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1121220024:0":{"text":"대답 기다릴게.","source_cn":"我会等你的回答。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98D32C84CE6E6DC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿尔法十一":{"text":"알파 일레븐","source":"阿尔法十一","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:维伦":{"text":"발렌","source":"维伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:霍根":{"text":"호건","source":"霍根","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"라이카","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:蕾米雅":{"text":"레미아","source":"蕾米雅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":25,"localized_text_count":24,"speaker_count":5}}